Saatvik Green Energy shares hit 10% upper circuit on 459% spike in Q1 profit,https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/stocks/news/saatvik-green-energy-shares-in-focus-after-massive-459-yoy-jump-in-q1-net-profit/articleshow/124404379.cms,"Thu, 09 Oct 2025 09:40:49 +0530","Saatvik Green Energy share price: Saatvik Green Energy reported a remarkable 459% YoY jump in Q1 net profit to Rs 119 crore, supported by new orders worth Rs 707 crore. Sequential profit rose 30%, while revenue was stable, reflecting strong growth momentum for the solar module and EPC services company."
